.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"The contributing institution believes that this item is not in copyright.","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"13363484":{"pageid":13363484,"ns":6,"title":"File:Mongolian Beef with rice and noodles.jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg/960px-Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":653,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg/1920px-Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg/960px-Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":653,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg/1920px-Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mongolian_Beef_with_rice_and_noodles.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=13363484","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2011-02-18 18:18:29","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Mongolian Beef with rice and noodles","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Nikon D60|Mongolian beef|Flickr images reviewed by File Upload Bot (Magnus Manske)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>Crock pot Mongolian beef over rice noodles served with white rice.\n</p><p>Adapted from the best parts of multiple recipes, mainly <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://allrecipes.com/Recipe/Slow-Cooker-Mongolian-Beef/Detail.aspx\">this one</a>\n</p><p><b>Recipe - </b>\n</p><p><b>Ingredients:</b>\n12 oz steak, sliced thinly\n1/4 cup cornstarch\n</p><p>2 tbsp oil\n1 yellow onion, sliced in small wedges\n6-8 green onions, sliced in 1/2 inch increments\n1/2 cup water\n1/3 cup soy sauce\n1/3 cup hoisin sauce\n1/4 cup brown sugar\n1 clove garlic\n1/4 tsp fresh ginger root zest\nCrushed red pepper to taste (for a spicy dish)\n</p><p><b>Method:</b>\nLightly coat steak in cornstarch, let sit 10+ min. Heat 2T oil in saucepan. When oil is hot, sear steak for a few minutes.\n</p><p>Add water, soy sauce, hoisin sauce, brown sugar, garlic, ginger, and red pepper (optional) to the crock pot, stir until well mixed. Add steak to the crock pot.\n</p><p>Total cook time should be at least 4 hours, but you can cook longer if time permits.\n</p><p><b>1-2 hours</b> before serving, add yellow onions to crock pot. \n<b>30 minutes</b> before serving add green onions. \n</p>\nServe over rice noodles (optional, but tasty) with white rice on the side.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2010-03-21 18:37","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/crd/4452204871/\">Mongolian Beef</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Uploaded by <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:McGeddon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"User:McGeddon\">McGeddon</a></li></ul>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/61324768@N00\">Craig Dugas</a> from Bozeman, Montana, USA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"70862107":{"pageid":70862107,"ns":6,"title":"File:Stuffed Peppers Florentine.jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg/960px-Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":640,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg/1920px-Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg/960px-Stuffed_Peppers_Florentine.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm